{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_01",
      "hash": "6377cae5824865b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「呵呵呵！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳擊敗了阿波羅嗎……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_02",
      "hash": "6377c7e582486098",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能來到這裡，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳確實不簡單。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_05",
      "hash": "6377cee582486c7d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "對火箭隊來說，\\n全世界的寶可夢都是\\r\\n用來牟取財富的犯罪工具！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_06",
      "hash": "6377cbe582486764",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "而我阪木，\\n就是火箭隊的老大！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_12",
      "hash": "637b51e5824b80ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……什麼？\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳叫我放了卡拉卡拉？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0740_karakara_01",
      "hash": "23dd5c22364b2f1e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉「馬麻馬麻！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_13",
      "hash": "637b50e5824b7f3a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阪木「啊哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_14",
      "hash": "637b4be5824b76bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "想不到竟然有人為了這種小事\\n闖進我們的基地。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_15",
      "hash": "637b4ae5824b7508",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "還真是個有趣的小鬼啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_07",
      "hash": "6377cce582486917",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不過……既然[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳膽敢冒犯我，\\n我就得讓[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳嚐點苦頭了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0740_dummy_01",
      "hash": "25781b19f3783aea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_03",
      "hash": "6377c8e58248624b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阪木「沒想到我竟然會\\n輸給一個小孩子！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_16",
      "hash": "637b4de5824b7a21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那邊的卡拉卡拉，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想帶走就帶走吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0740_karakara_02",
      "hash": "23dd5b22364b2d6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉「馬麻～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_08",
      "hash": "6377c1e582485666",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我不該小看[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這小孩子的。\\n這東西[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳拿去吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0740_sys_01",
      "hash": "cf2789eaf3ba5b91",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阪木把[VAR COLOR(0006)]西爾佛檢視鏡[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n交給了[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_04",
      "hash": "6377cde582486aca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……看來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳很認真\\n在培育[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_09",
      "hash": "6377c2e582485819",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "但是像[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這樣的孩子\\n恐怕是無法理解我的理想吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_10",
      "hash": "637b4fe5824b7d87",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……！\\n這次我就認栽了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_11",
      "hash": "637b4ee5824b7bd4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "希望之後還有機會\\n再跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一較高下……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0740_karakara_03",
      "hash": "23dd5a22364b2bb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉「馬啊麻！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0740_sys_02",
      "hash": "cf2786eaf3ba5678",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉回[VAR COLOR(0006)]紫苑鎮[VAR COLOR(0000)]去了！\\n"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main0740_sys_03",
      "hash": "cf2787eaf3ba582b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了西爾佛檢視鏡，\\n說不定就能知道\\r\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]幽靈[VAR COLOR(0000)]的真面目了……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketchief_01",
      "hash": "931be10778a8be15",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波羅「……卡拉卡拉好像\\n已經自己回去了。\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也趕快離開這裡，\\n找個地方去想想\\r\\n該怎麼活用西爾佛檢視鏡吧？"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0740_max",
      "hash": "0ac7d547bdee57fe"
    }
  ]
}
